        <activityName xml:lang="en">District heat, at consumer, natural gas cogen 1MWth, economic allocation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: District heat, at consumer, natural gas cogen 1MWth, economic allocation
Inventory is valid for the district heat based on heat from natural gas in cogeneration plant only. Heat loss is 11% while heat transportation. For heat from cogeneration allocation exergy was used.;
UUID: d74b8a58-fd7e-32ce-91bc-c5181828dbc6
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat, the losses and the heat from natural gas at cogen 1MWth.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d74b8a58-fd7e-32ce-91bc-c5181828dbc6.xml</text>
